    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92135" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾰκό-ω</span></b> , in 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>become ragged</i>
			or <i>wrinkled</i>, of skins of dead animals, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.642e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρρακωμένα πρόσωπα</span>
			<i>wrinkled</i> faces, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.87.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be dispersed all about</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χολῶδες . . ῥακούμενον ἐν τῷ
					σώματι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					4.49
				</span></i>
			.</div>
